'''Imps''' slowly float towards Isaac, occasionally firing 5 projectiles at Isaac in quick succession and can also occasionally randomly teleport around the room. They move slightly to try to avoid Isaac's tears.
{{clear}}

=== Baby Begotten ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Baby Begotten
 | id          = 883
 | base hp     = 18
 | stage hp    = 3
 | environment = {{floor|Mausoleum}}{{floor|Gehenna}}<br>{{room|challenge}}
 | behavior    = Floats toward Isaac, avoiding his tears. After getting close, fires a short {{i|Brimstone}} laser in the closest cardinal direction and propels itself away from him.
}}

'''Baby Begottens''' float toward Isaac, attempting to avoid Isaac's tears as it approaches. After getting close to him, it lines itself up with him in the closest cardinal direction and fires a thin short-range {{i|Brimstone}} laser at him, propelling itself in the opposite direction.

Despite their namesake and visual similarities to {{e|Begotten}}s they have no similarities in behavior.
{{clear}}

